{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-cluster-fleet","title":"多集群舰队管理：GitOps 在大规模集群环境中的扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gitops-declarative-delivery/operations/multi-cluster-fleet","wordCount":1095,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"多集群舰队管理-gitops-在大规模集群环境中的扩展\">多集群舰队管理：GitOps 在大规模集群环境中的扩展</h1><p>从单集群到多集群是 GitOps 系统成熟的标志。一个典型的中等规模平台可能有：3 个可用区 × 3 套环境（dev/staging/prod）= 9 个集群，再加上不同地区的生产集群，总数轻松超过 20 个。手工维护每个集群的 GitOps 配置是不可扩展的——需要&quot;舰队（Fleet）&quot;级别的管理机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ApplicationSet</td>\n<td>Argo CD 的 CRD，通过模板和 Generator 批量生成 Application，一个 ApplicationSet 可以为数十个集群生成对应的 Application</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cluster Generator</td>\n<td>ApplicationSet 的 Generator 类型，自动发现已注册集群并按 label selector 过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Matrix Generator</td>\n<td>将两个 Generator 的结果做笛卡尔积，常用于&quot;应用列表 × 集群列表&quot;的组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git Generator</td>\n<td>读取 Git 仓库中的目录结构或文件内容来生成 ApplicationSet 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群注册</td>\n<td>将外部 Kubernetes 集群的访问凭证注册到 Argo CD，以便 Argo CD 向该集群 apply 资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rancher Fleet</td>\n<td>SUSE 开源的多集群 GitOps 工具，专为大规模集群舰队（数百个集群）设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群标签策略</td>\n<td>通过统一的 label 体系标记集群的环境、区域、层级，供 ApplicationSet selector 使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多集群-gitops-的核心挑战\">多集群 GitOps 的核心挑战</h2><p>单集群 GitOps 只需要考虑&quot;如何让集群状态与 Git 一致&quot;。多集群 GitOps 需要额外处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>集群注册与认证</strong>：如何让调谐器知道哪些集群存在，以及如何访问它们</li>\n<li><strong>差异化配置</strong>：不同集群有不同的资源配额、域名、区域标签等配置</li>\n<li><strong>配置传播</strong>：基础设施组件（cert-manager、ingress-nginx）需要在所有集群部署</li>\n<li><strong>集群生命周期</strong>：集群创建/升级/退役时如何自动同步或清理配置</li>\n<li><strong>权限边界</strong>：多租户场景下防止一个团队的配置影响另一个团队的集群</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"argo-cd-多集群-集群注册与-applicationset\">Argo CD 多集群：集群注册与 ApplicationSet</h2><h3 id=\"集群注册\">集群注册</h3><p>Argo CD 的多集群管理基于&quot;外部集群注册&quot;机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 将外部集群注册到 Argo CD（使用 kubeconfig）&#10;argocd cluster add prod-us-east-1 \\&#10;  --name prod-us-east-1 \\&#10;  --in-cluster  # 使用当前 kubeconfig context&#10;&#10;# 或者指定 kubeconfig&#10;argocd cluster add prod-eu-west-1 \\&#10;  --kubeconfig ~/.kube/config \\&#10;  --kube-context eks-prod-eu-west-1 \\&#10;  --name prod-eu-west-1&#10;&#10;# 查看已注册集群&#10;argocd cluster list&#10;# SERVER                              NAME              VERSION  STATUS&#10;# https://prod-us-east-1.example.com  prod-us-east-1    1.29     Successful&#10;# https://prod-eu-west-1.example.com  prod-eu-west-1    1.29     Successful&#10;# https://kubernetes.default.svc      in-cluster        1.29     Successful\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 将外部集群注册到 Argo CD（使用 kubeconfig）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prod-us-east-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prod-us-east-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --in-cluster</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 使用当前 kubeconfig context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或者指定 kubeconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prod-eu-west-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --kubeconfig</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.kube/config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --kube-context</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eks-prod-eu-west-1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prod-eu-west-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看已注册集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">argocd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cluster</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># SERVER                              NAME              VERSION  STATUS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># https://prod-us-east-1.example.com  prod-us-east-1    1.29     Successful</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># https://prod-eu-west-1.example.com  prod-eu-west-1    1.29     Successful</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># https://kubernetes.default.svc      in-cluster        1.29     Successful</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注册后，Argo CD 在目标集群中创建一个 ServiceAccount，并将凭证存储在 Argo CD 所在集群的 Secret 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 自动创建的集群 Secret（Argo CD 管理）&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Secret&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: cluster-prod-us-east-1&#10;  namespace: argocd&#10;  labels:&#10;    argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: cluster&#10;data:&#10;  name: cHJvZC11cy1lYXN0LTE= # base64: prod-us-east-1&#10;  server: aHR0cHM6Ly8... # base64: https://prod-us-east-1.example.com&#10;  config: eyJ0bHNDbGllbnRDb25maWcuLi4= # 包含 ServiceAccount token 和证书\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动创建的集群 Secret（Argo CD 管理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cluster-prod-us-east-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cluster</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cHJvZC11cy1lYXN0LTE=</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # base64: prod-us-east-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aHR0cHM6Ly8...</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # base64: https://prod-us-east-1.example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eyJ0bHNDbGllbnRDb25maWcuLi4=</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 包含 ServiceAccount token 和证书</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cluster-generator-自动发现集群\">Cluster Generator：自动发现集群</h3><p>ApplicationSet 的 Cluster Generator 可以自动为每个注册的集群生成 Application：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ApplicationSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: cert-manager-fleet&#10;  namespace: argocd&#10;spec:&#10;  generators:&#10;    # 自动发现所有注册集群&#10;    - clusters:&#10;        selector:&#10;          matchLabels:&#10;            env: production # 只针对生产集群&#10;            region: us-east # 且在 us-east 区域&#10;&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      name: &#39;cert-manager-{{name}}&#39; # {{name}} = 集群名称&#10;    spec:&#10;      project: infrastructure&#10;      source:&#10;        repoURL: https://github.com/example/fleet-infra&#10;        targetRevision: main&#10;        path: infrastructure/cert-manager&#10;      destination:&#10;        server: &#39;{{server}}&#39; # {{server}} = 集群 API Server URL&#10;        namespace: cert-manager&#10;      syncPolicy:&#10;        automated:&#10;          prune: true&#10;          selfHeal: true&#10;        syncOptions:&#10;          - CreateNamespace=true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ApplicationSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cert-manager-fleet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  generators</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 自动发现所有注册集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">clusters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 只针对生产集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">us-east</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 且在 us-east 区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cert-manager-{{name}}'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # {{name}} = 集群名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">infrastructure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        repoURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/example/fleet-infra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        targetRevision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">infrastructure/cert-manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{server}}'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # {{server}} = 集群 API Server URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cert-manager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      syncPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        automated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          selfHeal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        syncOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CreateNamespace=true</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"matrix-generator-集群-应用-的笛卡尔积\">Matrix Generator：集群 × 应用 的笛卡尔积</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ApplicationSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: all-apps-all-clusters&#10;spec:&#10;  generators:&#10;    - matrix:&#10;        generators:&#10;          # 维度一：应用列表&#10;          - git:&#10;              repoURL: https://github.com/example/fleet-infra&#10;              revision: main&#10;              directories:&#10;                - path: apps/* # apps/ 目录下的每个子目录是一个应用&#10;&#10;          # 维度二：集群列表&#10;          - clusters:&#10;              selector:&#10;                matchLabels:&#10;                  env: production&#10;&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      name: &#39;{{path.basename}}-{{name}}&#39;&#10;    spec:&#10;      project: &#39;{{metadata.labels.team}}&#39; # 从集群 label 读取所属团队&#10;      source:&#10;        repoURL: https://githu